      "writtenOn": "2018-02-28T15:15:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the unlikely case, you don\u0027t know this yet: I hate people using this (actually in the past it was not even an API) as this is a slippery slope:\ne.g. now if you call this function with interrupt disabled, it will re-enable them too early (and we are unlikely to audit all the current and future indirect usage).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 58,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 58,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "14231a1d20704dac5694b1bb491cc06a665642b1",
